    "intro_html":  "Ground turkey does the volume, a little chorizo does the flavor, and cream cheese ties it all into a silky sauce over shells with zucchini and blistered cherry tomatoes. Each bowl serves up \u003cstrong\u003e42 grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e at 736 calories for about \u003cstrong\u003e$4.04\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost). The chorizo-to-turkey ratio is the money move here.",
